invariant: INV-61
file: quic_config.c
catches: cnsa2_quic_test_ca_mldsa
reason: ch_quic_init takes a pin of the fixed length or longer, as the TCP
  mutant above does for ch_connect. test_cnsa2_quic_mldsa_cfg requires
  CH_EINVAL with nothing staged.

--- old
    return len == CH_PIN_FIXED_LEN;
--- new
    return len >= CH_PIN_FIXED_LEN;
